Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:08.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好嘞\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:10.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,终于恢复原样了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:12.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:16.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始果然还是有头发更帅\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:19.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好意思说 真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:25.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,秋天快到了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:34.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 好久没来地下城集市了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:36.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:39.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 最近是酒馆生意的旺季\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:41.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我一直抽不出时间过来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:45.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱的吊坠\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:47.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这个真不错\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:50.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但是有点贵吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:54.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老板 这个我要了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.55,0:00:56.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.93,0:00:58.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,直接给她戴上 盒子另外给我吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:07.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 我可不能收下\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:09.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟我受了你很多照顾啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.07,0:01:11.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很适合你哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:14.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生真是个撩妹高手\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:19.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那作为交换让我揉你的胸吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:21.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太差劲了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.83,0:01:30.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,第一次从男性那里收到礼物…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:34.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,总感觉有股寒气\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.47,0:01:42.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的 莉露酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.64,0:01:45.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:46.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.56,0:01:49.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也想要礼物啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.85,0:01:52.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 拿你没办法\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:01:59.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢肉对吧 别客气 放开吃\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.91,0:02:04.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是这样啦 阿始你这个笨蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:26.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:39.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（魅惑之力）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:41.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:44.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是莉露酱心情不好的原因啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:47.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露希望阿始能够\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:49.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,更多地把我当作一个女孩子看待\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:52.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就得\n培养自己作为女人的魅力才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.06,0:03:57.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好好洗澡就行了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:03:59.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是那样的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:00.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要像我一样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:03.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,努力变得更美啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:05.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要变得更加美丽\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:07.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,男人连宝石都会主动送到你手上\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:10.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但是阿始 没有送大姐姐什么啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:14.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,难道大姐姐不漂亮吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:17.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说啊 那个白痴\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:20.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有个这么漂亮的青梅竹马还无动于衷\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:22.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他以为自己是谁啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:25.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,虽说是这样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:29.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但我又不想借助魅魔的力量…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:33.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是魅惑魔眼噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:37.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要用上这股力量\n想让他送多少都行…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:43.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但那只是暂时的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:44.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且用了的话\n总觉得就好像是我输了 不是吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:50.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果阿始还是\n没办法变得非常喜欢莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:51.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我说不定会用…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:53.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 你很激进呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:54.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:57.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么才能使用魅惑之力呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:05:02.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 魅惑之力也因人而异\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:04.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只能等待你的力量觉醒了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:12.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天你也能使用的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:14.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,来 别垂头丧气了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.31,0:05:16.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明天我给你看个好东西！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:19.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？好东西？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:27.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 好可爱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.87,0:05:35.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你化了妆真漂亮 莉露酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:39.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你们聚在一起干嘛呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.13,0:05:41.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:48.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢？莉露 你的嘴唇怎么油亮油亮的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:51.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一大早就吃肉了吗？会变成胖子的哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:57.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好痛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:05:58.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太差劲了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.06,0:06:02.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你的体贴都丢到哪儿去了！\n给我捡回来！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:04.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:08.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我错了还不行吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:11.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来就是很像肉的油脂啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:16.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做才能让阿始喜欢上\n作为女生的莉露呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:18.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:22.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 原原本本的你就很好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:30.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等你长大成人\n一定会成为很有魅力的女人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:34.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原原本本的你就很好…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:40.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还是不行啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.73,0:06:43.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被随口敷衍了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:45.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:53.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我变得更强\n魅惑的能力应该就能觉醒…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:56.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要赶快升级\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:59.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,用魅惑之力操纵阿始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:03.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天你干活真卖力啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:06.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是刚刚的话起作用了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:08.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 与其说是卖力…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:11.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,总感觉今天的莉露好恐怖啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:13.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.43,0:07:19.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,砰\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:28.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！对不起…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:36.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！很危险！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:38.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,给我停下\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:42.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,给我停下啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:48.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得逃跑才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:03.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,站起来！那家伙心脏的位置\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:05.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你平常在分解肉的时候有看过吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:15.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:19.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:24.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是能做到吗 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:26.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:33.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,话说莉露全身都是血啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:37.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干得好 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:41.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可能真的就像大姐姐说的那样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:45.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就算能够使用魅惑之力来操控阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:48.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也没有办法体会到这种心情\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:52.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（莉露的等级提升 学会了魅惑的新技能）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:09:00.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢？你学会了什么技能吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:05.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也可以尝试一次吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.51,0:09:16.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 血流进眼睛里了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:29.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么 好厉害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:36.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是能够魅惑对方的技能吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:40.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然看起来等级差距太大就无法起效\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:42.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这可了不得啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:47.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,难得学会一个魅魔特有的技能\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:49.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么就只对这些家伙有效果啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:55.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这次一定能成功！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:06.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这次是有垃圾进眼睛里了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:13.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 这才不是莉露想要的技能！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:15.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（“魅惑之锁”！技能似乎对人类无效）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:21.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:24.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:26.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尼扬酱！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:35.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是鹿神的头套噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:39.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典就快到了 所以我先做好啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:42.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 有祭典吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:46.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,据说是献给丰收的大精灵\n鹿神的祭典噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.93,0:10:49.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 早上好 可可\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:50.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:53.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,丰收是什么意思？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:58.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是能收获很多食物的意思哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典那天会有好多小摊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:03.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,到处都是好吃的哦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:04.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:06.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我们也摆个摊怎么样？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:12.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把在地下城弄到的肉烤来卖\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:14.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢！我想做！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:15.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就这么定了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.38,0:11:17.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可可呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:20.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你强烈要求的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:22.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是不能帮忙啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:23.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:25.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们三个人一起干吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.51,0:11:26.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:36.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对对 就这样…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:38.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你别闹了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:42.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要磨蹭到什么时候啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:44.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 罗顿！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:48.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跟你可不一样 我们在认真做！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:50.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是就是！别妨碍我们！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:57.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,罗顿养的食蚁兽\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:58.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是很凶暴的哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:01.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快住手！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:07.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个干嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想被我的凯撒舔吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:11.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你们最好快跑\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:13.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,它的口水可黏了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.21,0:12:37.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:39.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,上啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:44.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 别这样！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:47.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要舔我啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:53.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒！停下 我让你停下！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:55.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我身上都黏糊糊的啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:00.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:04.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:08.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是沉睡在莉露体内的黑暗之力\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:10.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,暴走了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:12.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:13.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好帅气！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:19.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗之力 感觉很不错呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:21.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫莉露酱对吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:22.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,鹿神的头套\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们大家一起来做吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:26.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:30.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？祭典的头套？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:32.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯！祭典那天\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:35.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们约好了一起玩！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:37.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还要跟阿尼扬酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一起摆个卖肉的摊子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:40.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,卖肉的摊子？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:44.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们打算把\n在地下城弄来的肉烤来卖！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:49.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好期待祭典啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:03.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露的小摊 生意一定会很好的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.63,0:14:07.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候是什么样的来着\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:17.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,从小巷缝隙里偷看的景色\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:20.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是看着而已\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:24.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看着似乎很有趣的一切\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:31.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,希望莉露能玩得开心啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:45.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是魔兽的气息？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:53.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,来了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:54.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在那边！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:55.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,小心\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:13.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！为什么会有这么多兔熊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:17.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了！它们进村了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:28.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,驻村的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:37.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:41.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯… 它们突然越过大门\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:42.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,跳进来了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:44.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是第一次碰到这种情况\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:46.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:50.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这次是山狼吗！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:56.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚的月亮可真美\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.99,0:15:58.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:15:59.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,椅子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:06.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,箭射得真准 真了不起\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:09.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:11.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,椅子为什么会说话啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:17.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,来 这是奖励 你这头猪！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:19.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！非常感谢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:20.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再来一次！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.85,0:16:22.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大半夜的还真有精神啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:25.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因为快到满月了嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:28.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,古代人种一到这时候就会热血沸腾的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.15,0:16:33.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 还没有变得特别圆吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.28,0:16:37.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说什么“是吗” 你啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:39.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你捡到莉露酱的时候\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:40.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是解释过了吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:43.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你可是在养育我的同族啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.37,0:16:44.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得更上心点才行啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:46.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 交给我吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:48.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:17:01.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快到满月就会热血沸腾吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.16,0:17:27.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才魅惑之锁发光了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:33.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎光临\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尼扬酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:40.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再多烤点肉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:46.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,气氛越来越热烈了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:49.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也得去弄些肉来才行啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:52.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露要大干一场！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:54.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 阿尼扬戈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:59.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说了哦 你们要在祭典上摆摊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:02.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要烤肉！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.45,0:18:04.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我会去吃的哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:06.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！我们等着你来噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:10.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,光靠孩子应该会很辛苦吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:12.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会帮忙的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,遇到困难的话 随时告诉我们哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:15.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:18.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好期待啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:22.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真想快点烤肉啊 阿尼扬酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:23.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:28.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你昨晚做了什么梦吗？战斗之类的梦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.73,0:18:31.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没有啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:36.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,操控梦之类的力量也没用吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:38.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没有用啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:40.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚我睡得可香了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 那就好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:50.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,往那边跑了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:18.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:21.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-皱着眉头\n-然后啊 我就觉得\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:24.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-有什么烦恼吗？\n-能把肉做成各种形状应该会很有趣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.95,0:19:26.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 原来如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:28.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 最近半夜里\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:31.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是老有魔兽闯进来吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:32.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,关于那件事…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.08,0:19:34.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,每天晚上都这样 真是辛苦你了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:38.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还不知道原因是什么\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都很不安\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:43.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这事可麻烦得很啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:48.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把可可也叫来 来我家开作战会议吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:50.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！就这么办！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:52.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:55.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对村子来说 确实是个麻烦啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.28,0:19:59.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个？东云先生？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:04.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 没什么\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:21.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露… 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:32.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哇！莉露的手腕在发光！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.85,0:20:36.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你能把那光止住吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.45,0:20:44.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好像不行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:46.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.03,0:20:49.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露的手腕为什么会发光？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.41,0:20:52.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:56.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被封印的力量\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:20:59.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是因为封印在你体内的黑暗的力量\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:01.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正在觉醒！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:03.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,诶？真的吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:07.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不得了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:11.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露的黑暗之龙 居然要觉醒了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:13.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你还真是喜欢龙啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.31,0:21:18.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,事到如今也没办法了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:23.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,既然如此 莉露就要用这个力量…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:26.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为村子里的大家做贡献！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:33.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 这力量你得保密才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:36.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:42.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,秘密的力量\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:44.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,才更帅气不是吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:46.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,确实是这样！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:49.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就快睡吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:53.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有一点工作要处理\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:56.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:40.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下回 故乡和伙伴）\n
